WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.434
-As I mentioned earlier
in the show,

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:03.501
"The Exorcist: Believer"
just opened,

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:05.200
and we want to know
what the people

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.601
are saying about the movie,

00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:09.367
so we sent our writer
Mike Hanford to the theater

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:12.334
to see what you guys think
about "The Exorcist: Believer."

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:13.901
Check it out.

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:15.467
-Thanks, Jimmy.
I'm here at the movies

00:00:15.467 --> 00:00:17.133
to see what the public
has to say about

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:18.868
"The Exorcist: Believer."

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:21.868
[ Quirky music plays ]

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:26.634
♪♪

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:31.434
Turn down the "Dol-bye"!

00:00:31.434 --> 00:00:32.601
All right. What'd
you think of the movie?

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:34.567
-It was great.
-What was the scariest part?

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:35.934
-When she was getting
lifted up, like...

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:38.634
-Ohh! I was shaking.
I couldn't believe that.

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:40.200
-It was, like,
making my heart beat.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.601
Like,
"What's gonna happen next?"

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:43.000
-Same. What'd you guys
think of the movie?

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.734
-There were some good
jump-scares in there.

00:00:44.734 --> 00:00:46.267
-I drank so much ginger ale
during this movie,

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:47.601
I had to go
to the bathroom twice.

00:00:47.601 --> 00:00:49.167
What was the scariest part
of the movie to you guys?

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:51.000
-The earthquake
at the beginning.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.834
I actually was, "Oh, no, oh --"
the whole time.

00:00:53.834 --> 00:00:55.701
-I heard you say that
in the theater!

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:56.701
-You did?
-Yeah. Didn't you hear me say,

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:58.100
"Shut up!"?
I understand you do

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.534
a very good impression
of The Exorcist.

00:00:59.534 --> 00:01:01.267
-[ Deep voice] I don't know
what you're talking about.

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:04.200
Shut up.
Uh, um, uh -- [ Laughs ]

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.601
-At any point in the movie,
did you think

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.434
a dracula was gonna show up?

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:10.367
-No, no.
-I didn't, either.

00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:12.400
How would you rank this movie,
on a scale from 1

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.667
to awesome sauce?

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:14.934
-Buffalo sauce.

00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:17.267
-Buffalo sauce.
-Buffalo sauce!

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:20.100
"Awesome sauce" on 3.
One, two, three --

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.734
-Awesome sauce!
-All right!

00:01:21.734 --> 00:01:23.000
Awesome sauce.
I --

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.367
♪♪

00:01:25.367 --> 00:01:26.534
-That's good to hear.

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:28.133
Good to hear what people
thought of the movie.

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:29.467
Thank you very much,
Mike Hanford.

